   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: Our efforts to repair the devastation caused by the war with Gracia depend on the Dwarven builders who belong to Grey Column Guild. They have become quite influential here in Gludio as a result. If you can win their support, you will be able to rule the territory with an easy con…",
