  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-21.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-21.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: Now that you have defeated the headless knights, we will not have any problems transporting the freight. Well done, my lord! The only thing remaining is to quickly provide Pinter with the supplies he requested .",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !((qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 1) && npc.isMyLord(player))); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 2)); npc.isMyLord(player); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 3))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-22a.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-22a.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: I believe you should temporarily delay your plans to become lord. There are more immediate concerns you must attend to. (The quest cannot be completed during a territory war or castle siege.)",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !((qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 1) && npc.isMyLord(player))); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 2)); npc.isMyLord(player); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 3))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-22b.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-22b.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: This territory must be stable before you can become lord. I urge you to conclude alliances with nearby fortresses. (You cannot become lord when a fortress is in an independent status.)",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !((qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 1) && npc.isMyLord(player))); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 2)); npc.isMyLord(player); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 3))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-22.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-22.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: Now that Pinter and his men have the supplies they needed and the headless knight and his gang have been vanquished, I doubt we will have any further problems. Well done, my lord! Your popularity is soaring among the people of Gludio! Will you accept their wishes and formally bec…",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !((qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 1) && npc.isMyLord(player))); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 2)); npc.isMyLord(player); !(qs.hasMemoState() && (qs.getMemoState() == 3))"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I will do so, since it is the will of the people.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio 35100-23.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio",
     "event": "35100-23.html",
     "quest": 708,
     "to": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-23.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-02.htm",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: I believe you have the necessary character, my lord. But despite your good character, remember that you asserted your claim by force. To become the true lord of this territory, recognized by all, there is still something you must do.",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"What is it?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio ACCEPT",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio",
     "event": "ACCEPT",
     "quest": 708,
     "to": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-04.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-04.htm",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: You must win the support of the local forces in this land. If you can do so, the stability of your reign will be assured. I will arrange a meeting with them. There you must do your best to impress them. Please wait while I make the preparations, my lord.",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-08.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: An excellent idea, my lord! Their leader is Blacksmith Pinter of the Town of Gludio . I'm sure he would be grateful for any assistance you can offer. In fact, you need not do it yourself. You can appoint a trusted agent to act on your behalf in this matter. Simply let me know who…",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "3"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-12.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-12.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: %name%, your mission is to help Blacksmith Pinter of the Town of Gludio and win his support for our lord. We are trusting you to act wisely in this matter.",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "4"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-13.htm": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-13.htm",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: Where did the lord go? I cannot give you the details of this mission without first verifying that you are the one whom he selected. Bring him here now.",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-23.html": {
   "file": "Q00708_PathToBecomingALordGludio/35100-23.html",
   "quest": 708,
   "text": "Chamberlain Saius: Understood, my lord! I look forward to your wise and benevolent rule.",
   "header": "Chamberlain Saius",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
